  <item>
    <title>N18.女孩们已经放弃约会软件了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65093e6f5c88d2412644b7fc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65093e6f5c88d2412644b7fc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 19 Sep 2023 06:23:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好消息！好消息！</span></p><span></span><p><span>❤️牛小玲家！接客！（二手玫瑰口音版）</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友们！本期不是俺一个人solo了，特意邀请了两位朋友一起聊了聊当代女孩的情感生活～</span></p><span></span><p><span>包罗万象、要素过多！</span></p><span></span><p><span>有约会软件使用心得、线下date风韵趣事、长择和短择的选拔要点等等！</span></p><span></span><p><span>咱家人抓紧听起来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>👄嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小侯：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙ID：炊事兵7595</span></p><span></span><p><span>汪汪：</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙ID：富贵闲人王大拿</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌟内容摘要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">6:32</a> 约会软件上神连三问，狠狠拷打男嘉宾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="854">14:14</a> 简介里啥样的标签最招人烦？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1372">22:52</a> 关于「第一次约会就用优惠券」的大辩论！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1613">26:53</a> 约会迟到三小时？能不能原谅他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2095">34:55</a> 质疑韩女，理解韩女，成为韩女</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2411">40:11</a> 哭！送暧昧对象2000元衣服，竟是替身文学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2840">47:20</a> 搭子的本质是资源配置</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a> 白幼瘦男孩和土狗男孩成流行了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3316">55:16</a> 背包与塑料袋的选择艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《年轻的朋友们来相会》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《明天会会更好》</span></p>]]></description>
